[0.001, "o", "╭─────── core/switch_core/connections/catalog/supabase/connection.yaml ────────╮\r\n│ slug: supabase                                                               │\r\n│ name: Supabase                                                               │\r\n│ category: Database & Backend                                                 │\r\n│ description: Query Postgres tables, inspect database schemas, manage auth    │\r\n│ users, and execute RPC functions with your keys.                             │\r\n│ enabled: true                                                                │\r\n│ adapter: api_key                                                             │\r\n│ auth:                                                                        │\r\n│   type: api_key                                                              │\r\n│   refresh: none                                                              │\r\n│   api_key:                                                                   │\r\n│     fields:                                                                  │\r\n│       - name: project_ref                                                    │\r\n│         label: Project Reference ID                                          │\r\n│         secret: false                                                        │\r\n│         help: Found in Project Settings > General > Reference ID (e.g.       │\r\n│ abcdefghijklmnopqrst).                                                       │\r\n│       - name: api_key                                                        │\r\n│         label: Service Role or Anon Key                                      │\r\n│         secret: true                                                         │\r\n│         help: Found in Project Settings > API > Project API keys. Use        │\r\n│ service_role only if agents should modify tables.                            │\r\n│     identity:                                       