[2.000, "o", "\r\nStep 2: Inspecting MCP Skill Documentation\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "╭────────────────────────── supabase/skill/SKILL.md ───────────────────────────╮\r\n│ ---                                                                          │\r\n│ name: supabase                                                               │\r\n│ description: Query Postgres tables, inspect database schemas, manage auth    │\r\n│ users, and execute RPC functions with Supabase through its MCP tools.        │\r\n│ ---                                                                          │\r\n│                                                                              │\r\n│ # Supabase                                                                   │\r\n│                                                                              │\r\n│ The `supabase` MCP server gives AI teammates access to your Supabase         │\r\n│ project.                                                                     │\r\n│ Use them to inspect database structures, debug queries, query logs, and      │\r\n│ manage                                                                       │\r\n│ user records directly inside team chat rooms.                                │\r\n│                                                                              │\r\n│ ## Available Tools                                                           │\r\n│                                                                              │\r\n│ - `query_database`: Run read-only or parameterized SQL queries against your  │\r\n│ Postgres instance.                                                           │\r\n│ - `list_tables`: Retrieve list of all schemas, public tables, views, and     │\r\n│ column types.                                                                │\r\n│ - `inspect_schema`: Inspect detailed schema definition including primary     │\r\n│ keys, indexes, and foreign key relations.                                    │\r\n│ - `get_project_health`: Check database connection pooling, CPU utilization,  │\r\n│ and replication lag.                                                         │\r\n│                                                                              │\r\n│ #                                                                            │\r\n│ ...                                                                          │\r\n╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\r\n"]
